OL,3,AChina to pump $54bn into state banks
OL,4,Aand insurers to boost economy
OL,5,
OL,6,FChina is pumping tens of billions of
OL,7,Fdollars into eight state-owned banks
OL,8,Fand insurance companies to help shore
OL,9,Fup the country's financial system and
OL,10,Fboost its slowing economy.
OL,12,FThe cash injection, which is being led
OL,13,Fby China's finance ministry, will total
OL,14,F360 billion yuan ($53.6bn; #39.7bn),
OL,15,Fstate news agency Xinhua said on
OL,16,FSunday.
OL,18,FThe outlet said the move "will help
OL,19,Ffurther enhance their sound operating
OL,20,Fcapabilities, risk resistance
OL,21,Fcapabilities, and ability to serve the
OL,22,Freal economy".
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
