OL,3,AChina to pump $54bn into state banks
OL,4,Aand insurers to boost economy
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt marks the latest move in Beijing's
OL,7,Fattempts to reinvigorate the world's
OL,8,Fsecond largest economy as it faces
OL,9,Fissues including trade tensions with
OL,10,Fthe West, the impact of the Iran war
OL,11,Fand an aging population.
